L51: ## 4. Convert to RKNN
L52: 
L53: *Usage:*
L54: 
L55: ```shell
L56: cd python
L57: python convert.py <onnx_model> <TARGET_PLATFORM> <dtype(optional)> <output_rknn_path(optional)>
L58: # such as:
L59: python convert.py ../model/yolo11n.onnx rk3588
L60: # output model will be saved as ../model/yolo11.rknn
L61: ```
