L63: *Description:*
L64: - `<onnx_model>`: Specify ONNX model path.
L65: - `<TARGET_PLATFORM>`: Specify NPU platform name. Such as 'rk3588'.
L66: - `<dtype>(optional)`: Specify as `i8`, `u8` or `fp`. `i8`/`u8` for doing quantization, `fp` for no quantization. Default is `i8`/`u8`.
L67: - `<output_rknn_path>(optional)`: Specify save path for the RKNN model, default save in the same directory as ONNX model with name `yolo11.rknn`
